{"id":32854,"date":"2026-01-13T16:58:47","date_gmt":"2026-01-13T21:58:47","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/elevateaudiology.com\/?p=32854"},"modified":"2026-01-13T17:46:47","modified_gmt":"2026-01-13T22:46:47","slug":"elevate-audiology-announces-greenville-location","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/elevateaudiology.com\/elevate-audiology-announces-greenville-location\/","title":{"rendered":"Elevate Audiology Announces Greenville Location"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<p>We are thrilled to share a BIG announcement: Elevate Audiology is opening a second location in Greenville, SC!<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>This expansion allows us to better serve our current patients who live, work or travel through Greenville, and it provides even more convenient access to care as we continue adding new and advanced services such as auditory processing disorder evaluations and therapy.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>New Greenville Location<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>2086 Woodruff Rd.<\/strong><br><strong>Suite B<\/strong><br><strong>Greenville, SC 29607<\/strong><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>Located on Woodruff Road near the intersection of Hwy 14, within the Woodruff Road Professional Park.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">What This Means for Your Care<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Dr. Tarvin and Dr. Ooms will be seeing patients at both the Easley and Greenville locations on different days to ensure continuity of care.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Dr. Cioli will be working full time in our Easley office, continuing to support our patients there.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Jaymee will likely be working in Greenville most days to welcome and support patients onsite.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<p>If you would like your next appointment to be in Greenville, simply call us at <a href=\"tel:+18654425555\">865-442-5555<\/a>. We\u2019ll be happy to help you get rescheduled once the calendar opens.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Our Team Is Growing, Too!<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p>We\u2019re also thrilled to welcome Shannon, who is currently in training to become our new audiology assistant in Easley.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>We are so grateful for your trust in our practice and excited to continue elevating hearing, tinnitus, and auditory processing care throughout the Upstate community. Stay tuned for more updates as we prepare to open our Greenville doors!<\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>We are thrilled to share a BIG announcement: Elevate Audiology is opening a second location in Greenville, SC! This expansion allows us to better serve our current patients who live, work or travel through Greenville, and it provides even more convenient access to care as we continue adding new and advanced services such as auditory&#8230;<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":3,"featured_media":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"_seopress_robots_primary_cat":"none","_seopress_titles_title":"","_seopress_titles_desc":"","_seopress_robots_index":"","schema":"","fname":"","lname":"","position":"","credentials":"","placeID":"","no_match":false,"name":"","company":"","review":"","address":"","city":"","state":"","zip":"","lat":"","lng":"","phone1":"","phone2":"","fax":"","mon1":"","mon2":"","tue1":"","tue2":"","wed1":"","wed2":"","thu1":"","thu2":"","fri1":"","fri2":"","sat1":"","sat2":"","sun1":"","sun2":"","hours-note":"","footnotes":""},"categories":[47],"tags":[],"class_list":["post-32854","post","type-post","status-publish","format-standard","hentry","category-news"],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/elevateaudiology.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/32854","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/elevateaudiology.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/elevateaudiology.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/post"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/elevateaudiology.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/3"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/elevateaudiology.com\/wp